SUMMARY:Sam Jay LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260813T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nSam Jay i
	s a stand-up comic\, actor\, and Emmy-nominated writer best known as the h
	ost and executive producer of HBO’s Pause with Sam Jay\, a weekly late-nig
	ht series. \nShe is a two-time Emmy nominee and WGA Award nominee for her 
	writing on Saturday Night Live. Sam debuted her first one-hour stand-up sp
	ecial Sam Jay: 3 in the Morning on Netflix in 2020\, and her next special 
	Sam Jay: Salute Me or Shoot Me premiered on HBO. \nSam has appeared in the
	 Kenya Barris-directed Netflix film You People alongside Jonah Hill\, Eddi
	e Murphy\, and Julia Louis-Dreyfus\, and co-created the Peacock series Bus
	t Down. She was named one of Variety’s 10 Comics to Watch and a Comedy Cen
	tral Comic to Watch. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 13\, 2026\
	nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\
	, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nFo
	od & Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nL
	augh Out Loud Comedy Club (LOL San Antonio) is San Antonio’s premier stand
	-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 
	410 and Blanco\, just inside the loop and a few miles from the airport. \n
	The intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat 
	feels close to the stage\, making for an incredibly personal and engaging 
	comedy experience. \nThe venue features a full bar and dining service\, so
	 guests can enjoy food and drinks throughout the show. Seating is first co
	me\, first served by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure 
	the best seats. \nLOL San Antonio is part of the nationally recognized Imp
	rov comedy club network\, consistently bringing top-tier national touring 
	comedians to San Antonio. \nWhat to Expect\nSam Jay delivers a full headli
	ning stand-up set packed with her signature sharp wit\, candid observation
	s\, and fearless comedic voice. \nExpect incisive commentary on modern lif
	e\, relationships\, and culture delivered with the same unfiltered energy 
	that has made her one of the most acclaimed comedians working today. \nThi
	s is an 18+ event. Arrive early to grab a great seat and enjoy the full cl
	ub experience with food and drinks before the show begins. \nTicket Inform
	ation\nPrice Range: $22 – $40 (plus fees) \nTickets are available through 
	official and resale channels: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post
	 contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to yo
	u.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/sam-jay-live-at-laugh-out-loud-come
	dy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sam-jay-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-
	club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\
	, TX\, 78216\, USA
