SUMMARY:Corey Holcomb LIVE at Raleigh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nCorey Hol
	comb is one of stand-up comedy’s most electrifying and unfiltered voices. 
	Going from hanging in the hood to performing on Jay Leno’s Tonight Show\, 
	Corey’s comedy genius transcends class and racial divides. If you understa
	nd English\, his humor will tickle your funny bone — and then some. \nKnow
	n for his razor-sharp observations on relationships\, Corey has built a ma
	ssive following with his unique brand of comedy that blends auditory and v
	isual performance. His facial expressions alone can send an audience into 
	hysterics. He’s been described as a cross between Rodney Dangerfield\, Ral
	ph Kramden\, and a hurricane — and that’s not far off. \nBeyond stand-up\,
	 Corey hosts his wildly popular podcast The Corey Holcomb 5150 Show\, whic
	h began on The Foxxhole and has since amassed millions of listeners on You
	Tube and CoreyHolcomb.com. He also stars as ‘Boonie’ on Adult Swim’s hit T
	V series Black Jesus \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTim
	e: 7:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 5:30 PM)\nVenue: Raleigh Improv\nAddress: 12
	24 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC 27519\nAge Restriction: 21+ (valid ID requ
	ired)\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required in the showroom for all gu
	ests. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Raleigh Improv is the Triangle area’s premier
	 comedy club\, located in the heart of Cary’s Parkside Town Commons. Part 
	of the nationally recognized Improv comedy club chain\, the Raleigh Improv
	 offers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere where every seat feels close t
	o the stage. \nThe venue features general admission seating (first-come\, 
	first-served) as well as premium booth options that include a $200 food an
	d beverage credit. The full-service bar and kitchen menu make it easy to e
	njoy dinner and drinks before and during the show. \nParking is available 
	in the surrounding Parkside Town Commons shopping center lots. The venue i
	s easily accessible from I-40 and US-1\, making it convenient for guests c
	oming from Raleigh\, Durham\, Chapel Hill\, and surrounding areas. \nWhat 
	to Expect\nCorey Holcomb delivers a nonstop\, high-octane stand-up perform
	ance that leaves audiences breathless with laughter. His pace is frenetic\
	, his honesty is disarming\, and his humanity shines through every punchli
	ne. Expect sharp relationship commentary\, crowd-pleasing storytelling\, a
	nd the kind of raw comedic energy that only Corey can bring. \nThis is a 2
	1+ event with a lively Friday night crowd. Arrive early to secure your pre
	ferred seats\, order from the full menu\, and settle in for an unforgettab
	le evening of live comedy. VIP ticket options are available for a premium 
	viewing experience. \nNo cell phone use\, photography\, or video recording
	 is permitted during the performance. All sales are final. \nTicket Inform
	ation\nPrice Range: $35 – $100 (plus fees)\nTickets are available through 
	Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \nOfficial TicketsResale 
	Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at 
	no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-holcomb-li
	ve-at-raleigh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/corey-holcomb-live-at-raleigh-improv/
LOCATION:Raleigh Improv\, 1224 Parkside Main St\, Cary\, NC\, 27519\, Unite
	d States Of America
