SUMMARY:David Cross: Shootin' The Shit\, Seeing What Sticks LIVE at Punch L
	ine Comedy Club Sacramento
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout David Cross\nDavid Cross
	 is one of comedy’s most celebrated and boundary-pushing performers — a co
	median\, actor\, and writer best known for co-creating and starring in the
	 legendary HBO sketch series “Mr. Show with Bob and David\,” his role as T
	obias Fünke in “Arrested Development\,” and multiple acclaimed stand-up sp
	ecials. \nHis comedy is sharp\, political\, and brilliantly absurdist\, ta
	ckling everything from American culture and politics to personal observati
	ons with a fearless\, uncompromising voice. “Shootin’ The Shit\, Seeing Wh
	at Sticks” promises a fresh\, raw hour of material from one of stand-up’s 
	most distinctive voices. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\
	nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sa
	cramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Restriction
	: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sacra
	mento is Northern California’s premier comedy destination. Located at 2100
	 Arden Way in Sacramento\, this legendary club has been the go-to spot for
	 world-class stand-up comedy for decades. \nThe intimate setting features 
	general admission and preferred premium seating\, a full bar\, and a class
	ic two-drink minimum. The room holds a few hundred guests\, making every s
	how feel personal and electric. Ample parking is available in the adjacent
	 shopping center. Note: the 7:00 PM show on Aug 14 is sold out — check for
	 the 9:15 PM show or Aug 15 dates. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo headli
	ne performance of David Cross’s “Shootin’ The Shit\, Seeing What Sticks” t
	our. Multiple shows are available August 14–15\, so check for your preferr
	ed time. Expect sharp\, provocative\, and brilliantly funny stand-up comed
	y. Shows run approximately 75–90 minutes. \nTicket Information\nTickets ra
	nge from approximately $68 – $95 (all-in pricing\, fees included before ta
	xes). \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate link
	s. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycale
	ndar.com/event/david-cross-shootin-the-shit-seeing-what-sticks-live-at-pun
	ch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/david-cross-shootin-the-shit-seeing-wh
	at-sticks-live-at-punch-line-comedy-club-sacramento/
LOCATION:Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\
	, CA\, 95825
