SUMMARY:Bret Ernst LIVE at Pittsburgh Improv
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Bret Ernst\nBret Ernst i
	s a nationally touring headliner who has earned marquee status on the Suns
	et Strip and is one of the most consistently funny comedians working today
	. \nBorn in New Jersey and raised in South Florida\, Ernst is best known t
	o TV audiences from his recurring role on the hit Netflix series Cobra Kai
	 and his appearance in Vince Vaughn’s Wild West Comedy Show. He has appear
	ed on Comedy Central\, BET’s One Mic Stand\, Showtime’s Comics Without Bor
	ders\, and The Late Late Show on CBS. \nHis stand-up is sharp\, relatable\
	, and never vulgar — a rare combination that makes him a crowd favorite at
	 clubs across the country. Fans consistently describe his shows as non-sto
	p laughter from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14
	\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Pittsburgh Improv\,
	 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, PA 15120\nAge Restriction: 21+ Event\nShow
	 Duration: Approximately 90 minutes \nAbout the Venue\nThe Pittsburgh Impr
	ov is Pittsburgh’s premier comedy club\, located in the Waterfront enterta
	inment complex in Homestead\, PA — just minutes from downtown Pittsburgh. 
	\nThe intimate showroom seats approximately 300 guests with excellent sigh
	tlines from every seat. A full-service bar and restaurant are on-site\, wi
	th a two-drink minimum per person. \nFree parking is available throughout 
	the Waterfront complex. Easily accessible via I-376 and Route 837. Arrive 
	early to enjoy dinner before the show. \nWhat to Expect\nBret Ernst delive
	rs a polished\, high-energy stand-up set that covers relationships\, famil
	y\, pop culture\, and the absurdities of everyday life. \nHis quick wit an
	d natural stage presence make every show feel effortless and genuine. This
	 is a great show for date nights\, groups of friends\, or anyone looking f
	or a quality evening of comedy. \nThe Pittsburgh Improv typically features
	 a local opener before the headliner takes the stage. \nTicket Information
	\nTickets range from $25 – $60 depending on seating and availability. \nOf
	ficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may 
	earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/e
	vent/bret-ernst-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bret-ernst-live-at-pittsburgh-improv/
LOCATION:Pittsburgh Improv\, 166 E. Bridge St\, Homestead\, Pennsylvania\, 
	15120\, United States
