SUMMARY:Nate Bargatze: Big Dumb Eyes World Tour LIVE at Little Caesars Aren
	a
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nNate Barg
	atze is the #1 comedian in the world according to Pollstar — a Grammy and 
	Emmy-nominated stand-up comedian\, New York Times #1 bestselling author\, 
	actor\, podcaster\, director\, and producer who has redefined what it mean
	s to be a mainstream comedy superstar. \nHailed as “The Nicest Man in Stan
	d-Up” by The Atlantic and “One of the Funniest People” by CBS Mornings\, B
	argatze sold over 1.2 million tickets in 2024 alone and broke more than 20
	 venue records. Billboard declared he set the record for the biggest one-y
	ear gross by a comedy performer in history. \nHis Netflix specials — The T
	ennessee Kid\, The Greatest Average American (Grammy-nominated)\, and Hell
	o World (Amazon’s most-streamed original comedy special in its first 28 da
	ys) — have made him a household name. His latest Netflix special\, Your Fr
	iend\, Nate Bargatze\, debuted on Christmas Eve 2024 and was a global top-
	10 show for two weeks\, earning three Emmy nominations. \nBargatze’s comed
	y is clean\, wholesome\, and universally relatable — the kind of humor tha
	t brings entire families together for a night of pure\, unfiltered laughte
	r. His Big Dumb Eyes World Tour features all-new material and is one of th
	e most anticipated comedy tours of 2026. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, A
	ugust 14\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM EDT \nVenue: Little Caesars Arena — 2645 W
	oodward Ave\, Detroit\, MI 48201 \nPhone: (313) 471-7000 \nContent: Clean 
	stand-up comedy — all ages welcome. \nAbout the Venue\nLittle Caesars Aren
	a is Detroit’s premier sports and entertainment arena\, located at 2645 Wo
	odward Ave in the heart of The District Detroit. Home to the Detroit Red W
	ings and Detroit Pistons\, the arena opened in 2017 and seats approximatel
	y 20\,000 for concerts and major events. \nThe arena features state-of-the
	-art sound and lighting\, multiple concession levels\, premium club spaces
	\, and excellent sightlines from virtually every seat. The venue is design
	ed for large-scale entertainment experiences\, making it the perfect setti
	ng for a comedian of Nate Bargatze’s caliber and reach. \nLittle Caesars A
	rena is easily accessible from downtown Detroit\, with multiple parking st
	ructures and public transit options nearby. The surrounding District Detro
	it neighborhood offers dining and entertainment options before and after t
	he show. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a world-class arena comedy experience fe
	aturing Nate Bargatze performing all-new material from his Big Dumb Eyes b
	ook and tour. His shows are known for their warmth\, storytelling\, and th
	e kind of clean\, feel-good humor that leaves audiences of all ages in tea
	rs of laughter. \nThis is a full arena production with professional lighti
	ng\, sound\, and staging — a true event-level comedy experience. Bargatze’
	s ability to fill arenas while maintaining an intimate\, conversational st
	yle is what sets him apart from every other comedian working today. \nDoor
	s open before showtime. Arrive early to find your seats and enjoy the full
	 arena atmosphere. This is a family-friendly show — bring the whole crew. 
	\nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45 – $150 (prices may vary based on se
	at selection and demand) \nTickets are available now. Nate Bargatze has br
	oken arena records across the country — don’t wait to secure your Detroit 
	seats. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate lin
	ks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycal
	endar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour-live-at-little-caes
	ars-arena/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/nate-bargatze-big-dumb-eyes-world-tour
	-live-at-little-caesars-arena/
LOCATION:Little Caesars Arena\, 2645 Woodward Ave\, Detroit\, MI\, 48201\, 
	USA
