	Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAn Evening With Kevin Smith LIVE at Bricktown C
	omedy Club Tulsa\nLegendary filmmaker\, comedian\, and pop culture icon Ke
	vin Smith is bringing his celebrated one-man show to Bricktown Comedy Club
	 Tulsa. An Evening With Kevin Smith is an unforgettable night of storytell
	ing\, Q&A\, and laughs as the director of Clerks\, Mallrats\, and Dogma sh
	ares behind-the-scenes tales from Hollywood and beyond. \nEvent Details\nD
	ate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026 (also Saturday\, August 15)\nTime: 7:00 PM 
	(Doors open 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa\nAddress: 5982 S 
	Yale Ave\, Tulsa\, OK 74135\nAge Requirement: 18+ Only\nTicket Prices: Fro
	m $118 (General Admission) \nAbout Kevin Smith\nKevin Smith is the acclaim
	ed filmmaker\, writer\, actor\, and podcaster behind the iconic View Askew
	niverse — the interconnected universe of films including Clerks\, Mallrats
	\, Chasing Amy\, Dogma\, and Jay and Silent Bob Strike Back. Beyond filmma
	king\, Smith is a beloved live performer whose Evening With shows have bec
	ome legendary for their hilarious\, candid storytelling and audience inter
	action. He is also the host of the popular podcast Hollywood Babble-On and
	 a fixture at comic conventions worldwide. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilarious b
	ehind-the-scenes Hollywood stories from Kevin Smith himself\nInteractive Q
	&A session with the audience\nCandid tales from the making of Clerks\, Mal
	lrats\, Dogma\, and more\nPop culture commentary and personal anecdotes\nA
	n intimate\, one-of-a-kind evening with a true Hollywood legend\nMultiple 
	show times available August 14-15\n\nVenue Information\nBricktown Comedy C
	lub Tulsa is Tulsa’s premier comedy destination at 5982 S Yale Ave\, featu
	ring an intimate stage\, full bar\, and dining menu. The venue’s close-up 
	seating ensures every guest feels part of the show. \nTicket Information\n
	Tickets for An Evening With Kevin Smith at Bricktown Comedy Club Tulsa sta
	rt at $118. Multiple show times are available on August 14 (7:00 PM & 9:45
	 PM) and August 15 (6:00 PM & 8:45 PM). Limited tickets remain — book now!
	 \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate link
	s. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no ex
	tra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid
	 photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/a
	n-evening-with-kevin-smith-live-at-bricktown-comedy-club-tulsa/\n\nFrom Co
