SUMMARY:David Koechner LIVE at Denver Improv
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDavid Koe
	chner is a beloved comedian and actor best known for his iconic role as Ch
	amp Kind in the Anchorman franchise alongside Will Ferrell. He is also wid
	ely recognized for his years as a cast member on Saturday Night Live and h
	is recurring role as Todd Packer on The Office. \nBeyond his acting career
	\, Koechner is a seasoned stand-up comedian who has been performing live c
	omedy for decades. His stand-up is warm\, energetic\, and full of the kind
	 of big\, physical humor that has made him a fan favorite. \nExpect a hila
	rious evening with one of Hollywood’s most recognizable comedic talents — 
	a performer who brings the same infectious energy to the stage that he bri
	ngs to the screen. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nSho
	w Time: 7:30 PM MDT (Doors open at 6:15 PM)\nVenue: Denver Improv\, 8246 E
	 49th Ave #1400\, Denver\, CO 80238\nAge Restriction: 21+ event — valid ID
	 required\nTwo-item minimum purchase required per guest in the showroom\nA
	dditional shows: August 15 (6:30 PM & 9:15 PM)\n\nAbout the Venue\nDenver 
	Improv is Colorado’s premier comedy club\, located in the Northfield Stapl
	eton shopping district. The club features a full-service restaurant and ba
	r alongside its intimate showroom\, seating approximately 300 guests in a 
	general admission format. \nThe close-quarters layout ensures every seat h
	as a great view of the stage. Parking is available in the surrounding Nort
	hfield shopping center lots\, and the venue is easily accessible from I-70
	. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a headline stand-up comedy show featuring Davi
	d Koechner. The performance runs approximately 90 minutes and includes an 
	opening act. Seating is general admission — arrive early for the best seat
	s. \nCell phones\, photography\, and video recording are strictly prohibit
	ed during the show. Late arrivals will not be admitted more than 30 minute
	s after showtime. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $78\, plus fees. 
	\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We 
