SUMMARY:Majah Hype LIVE at The Wilbur
DTSTAMP:20260813T094912Z
DTSTART:20260814T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMajah Hyp
	e is one of the Caribbean’s most beloved and internationally recognized co
	medians\, known for his hilarious impressions\, infectious energy\, and un
	ique ability to capture the essence of Caribbean culture through comedy. B
	orn in Barbados and raised across the Caribbean\, he has built a massive f
	ollowing through his viral social media videos and sold-out live shows acr
	oss North America and the Caribbean. \nHis comedy is rooted in the everyda
	y experiences of Caribbean life — family dynamics\, island culture\, and t
	he universal humor of human nature. Whether he’s doing spot-on impressions
	 of different Caribbean accents or riffing on life in the diaspora\, Majah
	 Hype delivers laughs that resonate with audiences of all backgrounds. His
	 Boston debut at The Wilbur is sure to be an unforgettable night of Caribb
	ean-infused comedy. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTi
	me: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, 
	Boston\, MA 02116\nAge Restriction: 18+ recommended\nTicket Prices: From $
	37 (avg. ~$71)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most icon
	ic comedy and entertainment venues\, nestled in the heart of the Theatre D
	istrict at 246 Tremont Street. This historic 1\,200-seat theater\, built i
	n 1914\, offers a stunning blend of classic architecture and modern comfor
	t\, making it one of the premier destinations for live comedy in New Engla
	nd. \nThe venue boasts excellent sightlines from every section — orchestra
	\, mezzanine\, and balcony — along with a full-service bar and a lively pr
	e-show atmosphere. The Wilbur is easily accessible via the MBTA (Boylston 
	and Back Bay stations on the Green and Orange Lines)\, and several parking
	 garages are located within walking distance on Tremont and Stuart Streets
	. \nWhat to Expect\nGet ready for a high-energy night of Caribbean comedy 
	unlike anything you’ve seen before. Majah Hype’s live show is a full-on ex
	perience — packed with impressions\, storytelling\, crowd interaction\, an
	d non-stop laughter from start to finish. His ability to connect with audi
	ences of all backgrounds makes this a show for everyone\, whether you’re f
	rom the islands or just love great comedy. \nThis is a solo headlining per
	formance\, and Majah Hype is known for going above and beyond on stage. Ex
	pect the show to run approximately 90 minutes. Arrive early to grab a drin
	k and get settled — this is one show you don’t want to miss a minute of. \
	nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: From $37 (average ~$71) \nSecure your 
	seats through official Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets throug
	h VividSeats: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affili
	ate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/majah-hype-live-at-the-wilbur/\n\nFrom Comedy Calen
	dar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/majah-hype-live-at-the-wilbur/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
