DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nAlfred Robles: Vatos 
	with Gatos LIVE at Brea Improv\nLos Angeles comedian Alfred Robles brings 
	his “Vatos with Gatos” tour to the Brea Improv for a multi-night run in Au
	gust 2026. \nKnown for his hilarious cat-loving\, street-smart comedy\, Al
	fred Robles has built a massive following through his viral videos and liv
	e performances. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:
	30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Brea Improv\nAddress: 180 S Brea
	 Blvd\, Brea\, CA 92821\nAge Requirement: 21+\nSeating: General Admission\
	, first-come first-served\nNote: Two-item minimum purchase required \nAbou
	t Alfred Robles\nAlfred Robles is a Los Angeles-based comedian known for h
	is unique blend of street humor and cat-loving comedy. He has built a mass
	ive social media following and tours extensively across the country. His “
	Vatos with Gatos” tour celebrates his signature style of comedy. \nWhat to
	 Expect\n\nHilarious stand-up from one of LA’s most beloved comedians\nThe
	 Vatos with Gatos tour — a unique comedy experience\nIntimate club setting
	 at the Brea Improv\nMultiple show times available Friday through Sunday\n
	21+ show with full bar and two-item minimum\n\nVenue Information\nBrea Imp
	rov is located at 180 S Brea Blvd in Brea\, CA. Part of the legendary Impr
	ov comedy club chain in Orange County\, CA. \nTicket Information\nTickets 
	start at $25 (plus fees). \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Ticke
	ts (VividSeats) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission
	 if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll 
	sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be requi
	red for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/alfred-robles-vatos-wit
	h-gatos-live-at-brea-improv/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
